<title>UK: Hambro Insurance plans share buyback.</title>
<headline>Hambro Insurance plans share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambro Insurance Services Group Plc said on Wednesday that it plans to seek shareholder approval to buy back up to 14.9 percent of the company's share capital.</p>
<p>By 1019 GMT, shares in the company had risen 2p to stand at 80-1/2p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
